{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"t":"Test 3","h":0.013464038026627767,"x":0.12954371905111509,"y":0.10009937631105226,"c":1,"w":0.057784989674886045},{"y":0.36918604630063556,"h":0.013081395583944833,"t":"F","x":0.13168724261698153,"w":0.014403292338053403,"c":1},{"y":0.14023639504672203,"w":0.73686457316080711,"x":0.17068098393672179,"t":"The device is aimed at a wide variety of users - from homeowners in the developing","c":1,"h":0.021252916333812988},{"x":0.17265959110633314,"y":0.15811512650484594,"c":1,"h":0.02248034572713653,"w":0.69994898478190104,"t":"world who do not have a constant supply of water to people living off the grid in"},{"w":0.73482630411783845,"c":1,"x":0.17065669408960776,"h":0.02005216286235767,"t":"rural parts of the US. The first commercial versions of the Desolenator are expected","y":0.17644593981731516},{"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"to be in operation in India early next year, after field tests are carried out. The market","y":0.19611307445052817,"x":0.17078189793172566,"w":0.74485595703124985,"c":1},{"x":0.17070881845601368,"w":0.73472534179687488,"h":0.019470100268037083,"y":0.21282307133417167,"c":1,"t":"for the self-sufficient devices in developing countries is twofold - those who cannot"},{"x":0.17070282358083413,"t":"afford the money for the device outright and pay through microfinance, and middle-","y":0.23054862477107751,"c":1,"h":0.019912609644014867,"w":0.73472539265950521},{"c":1,"t":"income homes that can lease their own equipment. 'People in India don't pay for a","y":0.24680055060666084,"x":0.17065342940798436,"w":0.72042277018229173,"h":0.022502290346035569},{"c":1,"x":0.1726633306077659,"h":0.02321323938448383,"w":0.72461817423502617,"t":"fridge outright; they pay for it over six months. They would put the Desolenator on","y":0.26549060400380486},{"y":0.28459311551202193,"x":0.17273609802377848,"w":0.72449061075846344,"h":0.019995086184659949,"c":1,"t":"their roof and hook it up to their municipal supply and they would get very reliable"},{"y":0.3020166118363723,"w":0.70599843343098956,"t":"drinking water on a daily basis,' Janssen says. In the developed world, it is aimed","h":0.021785333945697816,"c":1,"x":0.1727301849850672},{"w":0.71810699462890626,"x":0.17283950695996755,"t":"at niche markets where tap water is unavailable - for camping, on boats, or for the","h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1,"y":0.32122093006663988},{"c":1,"w":0.19135801951090495,"x":0.1728395085489631,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"military, for instance.","y":0.34156976726155208},{"h":0.020971235313460457,"x":0.17271112834280719,"c":1,"t":"Prices will vary according to where it is bought. In the developing world, the price","y":0.36493510471380031,"w":0.72043024698893221},{"y":0.38330672693376011,"w":0.72858922322591146,"c":1,"x":0.17480192112178125,"t":"will depend on what deal aid organisations can negotiate. In developed countries, it","h":0.020278454388550027},{"w":0.71850021362304695,"h":0.023985124729547391,"c":1,"t":"is likely to come in at $1,000 (£685) a unit, said Janssen. 'We are a venture with a","y":0.39937864218544572,"x":0.17264349017807015},{"t":"social mission. We are aware that the product we have envisioned is mainly finding","x":0.17276022777243477,"y":0.41961315138461364,"h":0.018816367195407913,"c":1,"w":0.72442499796549487},{"h":0.021662130232272925,"w":0.73280980428059894,"t":"application in the developing world and humanitarian sector and that this is the way","y":0.43632579887381007,"c":1,"x":0.17268339103513938},{"w":0.74307490030924483,"c":1,"t":"we will proceed. We do realise, though, that to be a viable company there is a bottom","y":0.45459117778929681,"x":0.17476485385080309,"h":0.023622538653082836},{"t":"line to keep in mind,' he says.","c":1,"x":0.17260596091133398,"y":0.47441640219748116,"h":0.020836900906512246,"w":0.26378509521484372},{"y":0.49994760455438381,"h":0.022930048660619762,"x":0.17477149895708466,"w":0.73487411499023436,"c":1,"t":"The company itself is based at Imperial College London, although Janssen, its chief"},{"h":0.02059305346054241,"c":1,"t":"executive, still lives in the UAE. It has raised £340,000 in funding so far. Within two","x":0.17480954646599373,"w":0.73679850260416679,"y":0.51859959636069597},{"h":0.02267385624322793,"t":"years, he says, the company aims to be selling 1,000 units a month, mainly in the","w":0.70815958658854172,"y":0.53602260943182189,"x":0.17471965106726997,"c":1},{"t":"humanitarian field. They are expected to be sold in areas such as Australia, northern","w":0.73251027425130211,"y":0.55523255797633664,"h":0.017500068610632802,"c":1,"x":0.17489712629151105},{"y":0.57375863497224788,"h":0.019621032427281193,"w":0.29862383524576819,"x":0.17477110150470451,"c":1,"t":"Chile, Peru, Texas and California."},{"t":"64","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.91569767422742721,"w":0.028806584676106778,"c":1,"x":0.13374485570721409}]}